  <data name="DocumentSettingPage_Error4214" xml:space="preserve"><value>Client patch error. Make sure the correct server patch is applied and copied to the game directory.</value></data>
  <data name="DocumentSettingPage_Error4301" xml:space="preserve"><value>Version data request failed. Your game version may not match the server's expected version. Update your game or check server requirements.</value></data>
  <data name="DocumentSettingPage_Error4308" xml:space="preserve"><value>Resource download failed. The server could not provide required game resources. Check your server's resource directory configuration.</value></data>
